{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10134010","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10134010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1013401001:2":{"text":"...루시우스, 나랑 자리 바꾸자. 내가 뒤를 맡을게.","source_cn":"——卢修斯，我们换个位置吧。我来殿后。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0F53E71CFAA5B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013401002:1":{"text":"아, 좋습니다. 여러분, 다른 사람에 대해 이야기할 땐 목소리를 좀 낮추어 주십시오...!!","source_cn":"啊，好的。拜托你们几个，讲别人的事情能不能别那么大声——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8156D6408382368E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013401003:3":{"text":"루시우스, 고마워요. 이젠 몇십 리 밖에 있는 마을 주민들도 다 들었을 거예요.","source_cn":"卢修斯，多谢你，现在几十里外的镇民也能听清楚了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B33C6E418D4EE27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013401004:2":{"text":"...듀라신이시여, 정말 미안해요, 테미히아...","source_cn":"……艾雅在上，特弥希娅，我很抱歉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x113509117DDFA3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1013401004":{"text":"...듀라신이시여, 정말 미안해요, 테미히아...","source_cn":"……艾雅在上，特弥希娅，我很抱歉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x113509117DDFA3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013401005:2":{"text":"음... 골렘 고대 전장까지 가려면 아직 한참 더 가야 해. 중간에 휴식 없이 한 번에 가긴 힘들걸.","source_cn":"嗯……距傀儡古战场还有些距离，恐怕不能一鼓作气地赶到那里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47187CE8EC507A8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013401006:1":{"text":"앞쪽에 영지가 있어. 우선 그곳에서 잠시 쉬었다가 다시 출발하자.","source_cn":"我知道前方有块营地，先在那里歇歇脚吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC8724E9C2148694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"크흠, 다른 얘기를 할까?","source_cn":"咳咳，换个话题","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0DB3F507056482","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"크흠, 다른 얘기를 할까?","female":"크흠, 다른 얘기를 할까?","variant_male_record_index":"61758","variant_female_record_index":"61759","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"쉴 곳을 좀 찾아보자","source_cn":"找个地方休息吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3920DDAA333E29A5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"쉴 곳을 좀 찾아보자","female":"쉴 곳을 좀 찾아보자","variant_male_record_index":"61760","variant_female_record_index":"61761","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"루시우스","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"아